      "result": "The user asks to translate a Chinese technical document into English, keeping terminology accurate. But no document is provided. I should ask for the text. No tools needed.\n\nShould I call tools? No — no real-time info needed. Just respond asking for the content.\n\nI should be direct and concise, and note that I'm ready. Also maybe give guidance on terminology choices. Keep it short.\n\nMaybe I can offer a sample of how I'd handle it. But the main thing: ask for the text.\n\nLet me respond in Chinese (user wrote in Chinese).\n\nI should mention: please paste the document; and if there are specific terminology preferences (e.g., 接口 = API vs interface, 算子 = operator, 分布式 = distributed), tell me. Also ask about target style: US vs UK English, and whether to keep code/commands untranslated.\n\nKeep it tight.请把需要翻译的中文技术文档内容发给我（直接粘贴即可，篇幅长也可以分批发）。\n\n同时，如果方便，请补充以下信息，这会让术语处理更准确：\n\n1. **领域/技术栈**：例如云计算、AI/大模型、数据库、嵌入式、通信协议等。\n2. **术语偏好**：文档中是否有必须沿用的译法或术语表（glossary）。例如：\n   - 接口 → interface / API\n   - 算子 → operator\n   - 分布式 → distributed\n   - 容器 → container\n   - 集群 → cluster\n   - 灰度发布 → canary release\n   - 高可用 → high availability (HA)\n3. **文体要求**：偏正式规范（规格书/白皮书）还是简洁说明（README/操作手册）。\n4. **英文变体**：美式 (US) 还是英式 (UK)。\n5. **不译内容**：代码块、命令行、变量名、文件名、产品名等是否保持原样（默认保持原样，仅翻译正文叙述）。\n\n收到内容后，我会按以下方式交付：\n\n- 按原文段落结构逐段对照翻译，便于校对；\n- 专业术语首次出现时保留英文原词，必要时在括号内附缩写；\n- 对存在多种常见译法的术语，标注选择理由或提供备选；\n- 保持原文的编号、列表、表格与技术参数格式不变。\n\n请把文档发过来。",
